abstract: >-
  Exact Hoeffding constants for centered linear contrasts of bounded finite
  exchangeable sequences, with parity-dependent formulas, hypergeometric
  tilted-variance bounds, a uniform odd-population Laplace comparison,
  extremizer classification and higher-order optimized proxy expansions.
keywords:
  - finite exchangeability
  - concentration inequalities
  - hypergeometric distribution
  - optimal sub-Gaussian variance proxy
